@picocss_com_examples_preview
row
  button "Skip to content" primary
  link "Pico CSS is no longer maintained. Read more" /docs/maintenance
  row
    link "Pico CSS homepage" /
    row
      row
        link Examples /examples
        link Docs /docs
      row
        link "GitHub repository" https://github.com/picocss/pico
        link Twitter https://x.com/picocss
        link "Turn on dark mode" /examples
  col
    h1 Examples
    text Minimalist templates to discover Pico in action.
    row
      col
        text HTMLJavaScript
        h2 Preview
        text A pure HTML example, without dependencies.
        link Preview https://4mrnhq.csb.app/
        link "Edit in CodeSandbox" https://codesandbox.io/embed/4mrnhq?view=Editor+%2B+Preview&module=%2Findex.html
        link "View source" https://github.com/picocss/examples/tree/master/v2-html
      col
        text HTMLJavaScript
        h2 Class-less preview
        text A class-less example, without dependencies.
        link Preview https://x4qtf8.csb.app/
        link "Edit in CodeSandbox" https://codesandbox.io/embed/x4qtf8?view=Editor+%2B+Preview&module=%2Findex.html
        link "View source" https://github.com/picocss/examples/tree/master/v2-html-classless
      col
        text HTMLJavaScript
        h2 Conditional styling
        text Example to apply Pico CSS styles selectively by wrapping elements in a .pico container
        link Preview https://kv4lrs.csb.app/
        link "Edit in CodeSandbox" https://codesandbox.io/embed/kv4lrs?view=Editor+%2B+Preview&module=%2Findex.html
        link "View source" https://github.com/picocss/examples/tree/master/v2-conditional-styling
      col
        text HTMLSass
        h2 Customized design system
        text An example to customize Pico CSS with SASS.
        link Preview https://gddt65-3000.csb.app/
        link "Edit in CodeSandbox" https://codesandbox.io/p/devbox/github/picocss/examples/tree/master/v2-sass-customized-design-system?embed=1&file=%2Fscss%2Fmain.scss
        link "View source" https://github.com/picocss/examples/tree/master/v2-sass-customized-design-system
      col
        text ReactSass
        h2 React class-less login
        text A minimal, class-less login page in React, with a custom primary color.
        link Preview https://zhghzt-8080.csb.app/
        link "Edit in CodeSandbox" https://codesandbox.io/p/devbox/github/picocss/examples/tree/master/v2-react-classless-login?embed=1&file=%2Fsrc%2Fmain.scss
        link "View source" https://github.com/picocss/examples/tree/master/v2-react-classless-login
      col
        text ReactSass
        h2 React color schemes and modal
        text Switch color schemes and open modals with React.
        link Preview https://jsj2d8-8080.csb.app/
        link "Edit in CodeSandbox" https://codesandbox.io/p/devbox/github/picocss/examples/tree/master/v2-react-color-schemes-and-modal?embed=1&file=%2Fsrc%2FApp.js
        link "View source" https://github.com/picocss/examples/tree/master/v2-react-color-schemes-and-modal
  col
